  "presentation_summary": [
    "60-year-old man on chronic prednisone for polymyalgia rheumatica presented with acute worsening of 12 months of lower back pain.",
    "He had right-leg radicular symptoms, falls, bilateral lower-extremity weakness, and new bowel-control loss, but denied fever.",
    "MRI showed L3-L4 discitis/osteomyelitis and an L2-L3 posterior epidural collection with mass effect and severe canal stenosis.",
    "Blood cultures and intra-operative epidural phlegmon grew Listeria monocytogenes; histopathology showed acute-on-chronic inflammation and abscess tissue."
  ],
